<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center"><B>INFORMATION CONTAINED IN THIS FORM 6-K REPORT</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">On August 10, 2026, WF International
Limited, a Cayman Islands exempted company (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;), released its unaudited financial results for the six months ended
March 31, 2026.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Attached as Exhibit 99.1 to this
report are&nbsp;the unaudited condensed consolidated financial statements of the Company for the six months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Attached as Exhibit 99.2 to this
report are the management&rsquo;s discussion and analysis of financial condition and operating results for the six months ended March
31, 2026 and 2025.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 48pt">&nbsp;</P>

